{"articleNo":"311648","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=311648&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[부속기관] [선발공고] 2021-2학기 생활관생 선발 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2021.06.11","hit":"25105","attachments":[{"name":"(공지)_2021학년도_2학기_생활관생_선발_공고문_.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=311648&attachNo=103802"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div><br></div><div><br></div><div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>첨부파일로 2021-2학기 생활관생 선발 공고를 안내합니다.</div><div><br></div><div>1페이지 외 상세사항은 첨부파일을 반드시 읽어보시기 바랍니다.</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"border-style: double; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(159, 211, 49); background-color: rgb(231, 253, 181); padding: 10px;\"><div><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">※ </span><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">정정안내</span><br></div><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace; font-size: 14px; white-space: pre;\"><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br></span></font></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace; font-size: 14px; white-space: pre;\"><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">일전에 학생들이 단일 지망만 선택이 가능한지 문의가 많았습니다.\n이에 대하여 다지망(여러지망)을 선택 가능하다는 의미를 기재하는 도중, 중복이라는 문구가 사용되었으나\n\n의미 혼동을 드린 것 같아서, \"여러지망이 선택이 가능하다\"고 문구가 수정된 상태입니다.</span></font></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace; font-size: 14px; white-space: pre;\"><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">\n참고하여 주시기 바라며, 관은 중복되지 않는 점을 다시 안내드립니다.</span></font></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace; font-size: 14px; white-space: pre;\"><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br></span></font></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace; font-size: 14px; white-space: pre;\"><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">감사합니다.</span></font></p><div><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br></span></font></div></div><div><br></div><div><pre style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; overflow: auto; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); line-height: 1.62rem; white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p><br></p><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"padding: 10px; border-style: double; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(254, 137, 67); background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">아름관</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">A</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">동</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">구 신평관</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">은 신평동 캠퍼스 내 외부업체에서 식당운영 예정</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">(2021-9</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">월부터</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">)</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"></p><div id=\"hwpEditorBoardContent\" class=\"hwp_editor_board_content\" data-hjsonver=\"1.0\" data-jsonlen=\"7187\"></div><p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">아름관</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">A</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">동 식사신청은 신평동에서 거주하지만 양호동에서 식사를 원할 경우에만 신청할 것</span></p></div></pre></div><div><div><br></div><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"border-style: double; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(121, 165, 228); background-color: rgb(219, 232, 251); padding: 10px;\"><p style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); white-space: pre-wrap; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 13pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 13pt;\">코로나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 13pt;\">19 </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 13pt;\">방지를 위하여 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 13pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 13pt;\">일 </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 13pt; font-weight: bold;\">통학이 가능한 학생</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 13pt;\">은 생활관 이용을 </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 13pt; font-weight: bold;\">지양</span><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); white-space: pre-wrap; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 30.4px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 13pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 13pt;\">사회적 거리두기 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 13pt; font-weight: bold;\">4</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 13pt; font-weight: bold;\">단계</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13pt;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 13pt;\">격상 시 정부 방역지침에 따라 </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 13pt; font-weight: bold;\">생활관 입사 불가</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 15.4pt; padding-top: 0px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); white-space: pre-wrap; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 30.4px; text-indent: -15.4pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 13pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 13pt;\">사회적 거리두기 정부 방역지침에 따라 </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 13pt; font-weight: bold;\">생활관 운영이 변경</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 13pt;\">될 수 있으며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 13pt;\">, </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 15.4pt; padding-top: 0px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); white-space: pre-wrap; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 30.4px; text-indent: -15.4pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13pt;\">  </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 13pt;\">배정된 관 및 호실이 변경될 수 있음을 생활관 신청 전 반드시 숙지</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); white-space: pre-wrap; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 30.4px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 13pt;\">- </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 13pt;\">푸름관</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 13pt;\">2</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 13pt;\">동 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 13pt; font-weight: bold;\">드라이비트 교체 공사</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 13pt; font-weight: bold;\">(</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 13pt; font-weight: bold;\">소음발생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 13pt; font-weight: bold;\">)</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 13pt;\">가 진행 중임을 감안하여 신청</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); white-space: pre-wrap; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 30.4px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 11pt;\">  <span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"> </span></span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">※ </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">공사 종료</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">: 9</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">월 중순 예정</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); white-space: pre-wrap; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 30.4px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 13pt;\">-</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13pt; font-weight: bold;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 13pt;\">신청 기간 외 </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 13pt; font-weight: bold;\">식사선택 변경 불가</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); white-space: pre-wrap; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 30.4px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 13pt;\">-</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13pt; font-weight: bold;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 13pt; font-weight: bold;\">등록기간에 생활관비를 <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">미납</span> 시 <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">별도 통보 없이 자동 탈락 처리</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold;\">(</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold;\">예외 처리 불가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &quot;Liberation Mono&quot;, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace; white-space: pre-wrap; line-height: 30.4px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 13pt;\">-</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13pt; font-weight: bold;\"><font face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\"> </font><font face=\"휴먼명조\">일반선발은 대학원&gt;2021-1학기 거주학생(중도 환불자 제외)&gt;2학기 신규신청자 순으로 진행됨을 유의</font></span></p></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://dorm.kumoh.ac.kr/cms/plugin/editorImage.do?EwBmEYHoQDkhrAhvAMgYQEYAl4EsCmA4gO4DSAggEIB2AHlgBoCeAdAFYAOA5kA%20\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p><br></p><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div></div></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
